{"de":[{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"German","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt34\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/go\" title=\"go\">go</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/walk\" title=\"walk\">walk</a>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Lass uns beide mit dem Hund <b>gehen</b>.","translation":"Let's both <b>walk</b> the dog together."},{"example":"Ich sah die Kinder über die Straße <b>gehen</b>.","translation":"I saw the children <b>walk/go</b> across the street."},{"example":"Mein Baby beginnt schon zu <b>gehen</b>.","translation":"My baby is already starting to <b>walk</b>."}],"examples":["Lass uns beide mit dem Hund <b>gehen</b>.","Ich sah die Kinder über die Straße <b>gehen</b>.","Mein Baby beginnt schon zu <b>gehen</b>."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt38\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/leave\" title=\"leave\">leave</a>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Ich <b>gehe</b> jetzt.","translation":"I’m <b>leaving</b> now."}],"examples":["Ich <b>gehe</b> jetzt."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt40\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/leave\" title=\"leave\">leave</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/take_off\" title=\"take off\">take off</a> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt41\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt41\">aeroplane, train</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt41\">)</span>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Wann <b>geht</b> dein Zug<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>","translation":"When is your train <b>leaving</b>?"}],"examples":["Wann <b>geht</b> dein Zug<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"]},{"definition":""},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\"></span> to be going; to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/all_right\" title=\"all right\">all right</a> <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r90144471\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt47\">.mw-parser-output .object-usage-tag{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output .deprecated{color:var(--wikt-palette-grey-lime-8,olivedrab)}</style>[<i>with</i> <span class=\"object-usage-tag\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#dative_case\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">dative</a></span> <small>‘for someone’</small> <i>and</i> <span class=\"object-usage-tag\">predicate</span> <span class=\"object-usage-tag\">adjective</span> <small>‘in a particular way’</small>]","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Wie <b>geht</b> es dir<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>","translation":"How are you doing?"},{"example":"Es <b>geht</b> mir gut.","translation":"I’m doing well.","literally":"It goes well for me."},{"example":"Es <b>geht</b>.","translation":"It’s all right."}],"examples":["Wie <b>geht</b> es dir<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>","Es <b>geht</b> mir gut.","Es <b>geht</b>."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt52\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/possible\" title=\"possible\">possible</a>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Das würde vielleicht <b>gehen</b>.","translation":"That might <b>be possible</b>."},{"example":"Ich zeige dir, wie es <b>geht</b>.","translation":"I'll show you how it's <b>possible</b>."}],"examples":["Das würde vielleicht <b>gehen</b>.","Ich zeige dir, wie es <b>geht</b>."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt55\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/work\" title=\"work\">work</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/function\" title=\"function\">function</a> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt56\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt56\">of a machine, method or the like</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt56\">)</span>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Der Kaffeeautomat <b>geht</b> nicht.","translation":"The coffee dispenser doesn't <b>work</b>."}],"examples":["Der Kaffeeautomat <b>geht</b> nicht."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt60\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/last\" title=\"last\">last</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/go_for\" title=\"go for\">go for</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/go_on\" title=\"go on\">go on</a>, to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/in_progress\" title=\"in progress\">in progress</a>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Das <b>ging</b> für eine halbe Stunde oder so.","translation":"This <b>went on</b> for half an hour or so."},{"example":"Die Sitzung <b>geht</b> bis ein Uhr.","translation":"The session <b>is scheduled</b> until one o’clock."}],"examples":["Das <b>ging</b> für eine halbe Stunde oder so.","Die Sitzung <b>geht</b> bis ein Uhr."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt63\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sit\" title=\"sit\">sit</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rise\" title=\"rise\">rise</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/expand\" title=\"expand\">expand</a> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt64\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\" about=\"#mwt64\">of dough etc.</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren\" about=\"#mwt64\">)</span>","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Teig drei Stunden <b>gehen</b> lassen.","translation":"Let dough <b>sit</b> for three hours."}],"examples":["Teig drei Stunden <b>gehen</b> lassen."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt67\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/be\" title=\"be\">be</a> (on); to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pay\" title=\"pay\">paid</a> for (by) <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateSt